OL,3,ARepeated air traffic control failures
OL,4,Aleave us in worrying territory
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo have one air traffic control failure
OL,7,Fin a fortnight may be regarded as a
OL,8,Fmisfortune, to have two looks like
OL,9,Fcarelessness. The UK's air traffic
OL,10,Fservices provider is coming in for a
OL,11,Fwave of criticism at the moment, so
OL,12,Fwhere is it all leading?
OL,14,FThe incident at the National Air
OL,15,FTraffic Services (Nats) main control
OL,16,Fcentre in Swanwick earlier this month
OL,17,Fwas extremely serious. It caused more
OL,18,Fthan 2,000 flight cancellations over
OL,19,Ftwo days, affecting hundreds of
OL,20,Fthousands of passengers. Some were left
OL,21,Fsleeping on airport floors, others were
OL,22,Fstranded in foreign airports.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
