OL,3,ARepeated air traffic control failures
OL,4,Aleave us in worrying territory
OL,5,
OL,6,FMonday's failure at the Prestwick
OL,7,Fcentre, which looks after air traffic
OL,8,Fin Scotland, northern England and
OL,9,Fnorthern Ireland was not as dramatic.
OL,10,FBut according to the aviation analytics
OL,11,Fcompany Cirium, it still led to more
OL,12,Fthan 200 flights being cancelled and
OL,13,Fmany other delays affecting tens of
OL,14,Fthousands of travellers.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
