OL,3,ARepeated air traffic control failures
OL,4,Aleave us in worrying territory
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first failure this month was
OL,7,Fattributed to a previously undetected
OL,8,Fsoftware flaw, which had an impact due
OL,9,Fto a very specific set of circumstances
OL,10,Fcombining in a millisecond. Today's
OL,11,Fissue was blamed on an unspecified
OL,12,F"connectivity issue" specific to the
OL,13,Fsystem used in Scotland. The two, Nats
OL,14,Fsays, were unrelated.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
